WEBVTT

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.170
Gauma...

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:23.540
Yomogi, may I?

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.380
He's healing?

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:33.850
No. It's not a Fixer Beam,
but it should ease his pain.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:38.560
We won't get an ambulance like this.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:42.020
Hang in there, Gauma. Knight.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.080
It's a <i>kaiju</i>!

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:03.080
What's going on?
I thought no more would appear.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:07.500
The world of <i>kaiju </i>isn't over just yet!

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.380
What's up, Juuga?

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.220
This <i>kaiju</i>...!

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:23.350
Could it be?! It's Sizumu?!

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:28.980
Take me with you, Sizumu!
I wanna see a future with <i>kaiju</i>!

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.740
How about you two?

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:40.660
I choose a future where more humans die.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:44.210
In the end, this is all I can do.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:59.680
What the--?!

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:06.020
This guy powered up even more?!

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:10.530
Gauma!

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.030
Thank goodness!

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:13.900
You okay?!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:19.700
Am I okay? Your face tells me
all I need to know.

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:24.250
I don't think... I've got long.

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.370
Stop it.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.880
What are you saying?

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:32.670
Yomogi... Yume...

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:40.140
Sorry for getting you involved
in this <i>kaiju </i>user mess.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:47.020
All that happened 5,000 years ago
has nothing to do with you guys.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.520
It has nothing to do with us?!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:55.400
Gauma, you brought us
into it yourself! With Dynazenon!

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:02.160
You're the reason
we all built this connection!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:08.580
I'm sorry.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:12.710
No, that's not it... Thanks.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.630
Tell Koyomi for me.

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:27.770
Tell him yourself. Live and tell him
in your own words!

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:31.860
Not so loud.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:36.780
Kaiser Knight Double Storm!

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:58.380
Let's go, Yomogi. There's still
something we can do.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.850
Second, take care of Gauma.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:04.100
Yeah. Be careful.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.470
See you later.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.520
Mmm.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.110
The train has come to an
emergency stop. We apologize--

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:26.500
It's all a coincidence, just like
that day. But what's different... is me.

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.540
What are you doing?!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:37.800
If I don't beat that <i>kaiju</i>,
those guys will lose their future.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:42.930
I sure as hell didn't revive
for a long, easy life.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:46.060
But you're in no shape for it!

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:53.360
In this world, there's three...
important things... you've gotta keep.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:56.730
Promises, love, and...

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.330
I like you. Will you go out with me?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:15.840
In the end, she never answered.

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.550
I missed my chance.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.310
Don't touch me!

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.690
Mujina?!

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.410
Ouch...

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:52.000
It's okay, Kano. I'm fine.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.420
Yomogi?!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:08.180
Let's go, Minami!
Everyone's waiting for us!

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.260
Mmm!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:17.770
Goldburn! Tell me you're alive!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:27.320
You really are the coolest friend
I've got in the world!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:47.930
No killing Chise's friend!
I'm sick of memorials!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.220
Knight!

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.850
Yomogi Asanaka?

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.110
Gauma?!

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:08.120
I came to give Koyomi my apologies.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.870
Sorry to get you involved.

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.580
Gauma...

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.710
What are we talking about?

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:22.000
I see. Guess I never told you.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.470
Gauma, I said to wait. Why are you here?

00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:32.060
I'm here to help
whether you like it or not.

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:34.600
Then don't regret it.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.690
It's time to combine our powers!

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.900
Right!

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:28.820
Super Dragon King Kaiser Gridknight!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.490
Slaughter all humans!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:37.450
<i>Kaiju </i>are gonna wipe you all out!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.800
We're not gonna let that happen!

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.630
Yeah! That's right!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:53.350
Kaiser Knight Circular!

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.220
Gauma!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:07.400
I looked up to you! I needed you,
and you needed me!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.450
And yet, you betrayed us!

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:13.280
And yet, I only liked you more!

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:13.280
Shuddap!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.620
I said not to show your face!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:23.250
This time, I'm gonna
make sure you stay dead!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:27.380
All I have is <i>kaiju</i>!

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:32.720
I realized they're all I've got,
and Koyomi's to blame!

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:36.850
If it's my fault, then I'm sorry!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:43.560
Even if you apologize,
I'll never forgive you!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.230
Get off me!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.030
Sizumu!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:58.910
He's not gonna talk to us, is he?

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:03.290
Rex...

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.130
...Grid...

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:08.590
...Fire!

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:20.640
Hang on, guys!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.230
Don't you lose to this!

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.530
Yomogi! What are you doing?!

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:37.990
Back then, it might've
been a coincidence, but...!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:46.290
Instance Domination!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.680
Now!

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:20.660
Combine Dragon Dynazenon!

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:25.080
Battle...

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.290
...Go!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:34.720
And followed by Dynazenon Full Burst!

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:37.930
Come, Goldburn!

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:48.730
What?!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.710
Super Dragon Dyna Rex!

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:21.390
Drop dead, you phoney <i>kaiju</i>!

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:23.680
Let's end this, Gridknight!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.770
Right! Together!

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:29.900
Blazing Hot Inferno...

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:31.360
...Burning...

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.860
...Grid...

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.980
...Rex...

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.950
...Roar!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.960
It's not over yet!

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:52.750
No! This is the end for you!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:05.640
I never thought I'd die again.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.020
Is it better this way?

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:11.600
No. <i>Kaiju </i>will have their future yet.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:29.910
Gauma?!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:30.710
Huh?

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.420
Gauma!

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:34.710
Let's get him to the hospital!

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:35.920
Right!

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:42.220
Nah... I don't wanna be
any more of a bother.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.390
Huh?

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:52.900
In this world, I couldn't meet you, but...

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:55.310
...I got to meet them.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:03.280
I think I finally know the reason why...

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:08.120
...you entrusted Dynazenon to me.

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:31.390
Huh? What about Gauma?

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:52.060
That scared me.

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:55.560
He's saying, "Let's not drag this out."

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:58.400
Your friend looks better now.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:02.070
Yeah. He's all healed up.

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:04.070
Who are you again?

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:06.780
Huh? Remember me already.

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:10.700
Gauma said in this world,
it's important to keep

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.740
--three things.
--three things, right?

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.620
Promises, love, and...

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.710
Um...

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:23.750
We must leave this world
for our next mission.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.670
Thanks for everything, guys.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:31.680
Same here. Thank you, Knight... Second.

00:16:33.140 --> 00:16:35.770
Thank you, Dynazenon.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:49.360
Thank you, Goldburn!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:54.740
You're the best friend I've ever had!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.790
Thank you!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:11.050
They're gone.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:12.220
Yeah.

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:14.220
We should get going.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.350
Ugh.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.520
Don't "ugh" me.

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.230
What's up?

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.610
Nothing.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:28.030
I so don't wanna go.

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.570
Still saying that?

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:30.570
Well...

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:34.830
Didn't we promise to make it a success?

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:38.040
Well, if you insist...

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.620
Entry Prohibited

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.620
Ayanashi City Ayame Public Middle School

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:45.920
Senpai, how many interviews did you botch?

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.380
Twenty-one.

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:52.760
In the end, it was your ex's husband
who got you a job?

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:57.470
She's not my ex. She's a friend.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.640
You schmoozed your way in?

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.770
Of course I did.

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:05.560
Now I really don't wanna end up like you.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.400
It's best if you don't.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.990
You look so weird in a suit.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:20.080
And you looked weird in a uniform.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.170
I could never pull one off.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.670
"School Festival"

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.920
"Fujiyokidai High School Festival"

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:32.760
"My Good Friends"
"Mei Kakui"

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:40.270
Hey, I said not to use me.

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:41.520
Did you?

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.640
I did.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:48.230
Yume, should you be here?
Isn't it your turn?

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.150
Shut up, Mom.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.610
You haven't changed.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:01.160
Isn't your turn coming up soon?

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:04.420
Yeah. You can pay at the entrance.

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:05.830
Okay.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:09.170
Hey, is Gauma coming?

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:11.330
"Horror Cafe"

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:11.920
Nope.

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:16.300
He got banned from our school.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:19.720
Huh? Why? What did he do?

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.720
--Yomogi!
--Yomo!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.770
What's up?

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.980
Minami's not coming.

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:25.640
Huh?

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:31.690
What's her deal? If you won't help prep,
at least help the day of!

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:29.860
She's coming up next,
but we can't reach her.

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:31.690
Yomogi, go find her.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.070
You're on Minami duty!

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:35.950
R-Right!

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:58.590
Hello, everyone!
We're the calligraphy club!

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:07.850
The recent <i>kaiju </i>have caused terrible
damage to Fujiyokidai and the area.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:12.440
♬ In your heart, you are... ♬

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:15.440
The calligraphy club extends our
deepest sympathies to all the victims.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:24.950
♬ A white, white bird
with huge wings... ♬

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:24.950
We hope our performance puts smiles
on everyone's faces, so please enjoy!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.250
There you are!

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:32.040
It's our turn to run the cafe,
so let's head back.

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:36.050
I really don't want to.

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:41.430
I know, but just do it
for the others in our class.

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.060
It's time to go.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:49.770
Then take me with you.

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:55.730
I just don't get it.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:05.330
You had the potential to be
a <i>kaiju </i>user, but you wasted it.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:11.460
I don't understand <i>kaiju</i>,
so I could never do it.

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:15.380
<i>Kaiju </i>can't be understood by people.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:18.670
They're beyond logic and reason.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:24.220
They're not bound by anything.
You witnessed it, right?

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.560
The power of <i>kaiju</i>

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:32.270
can free one from
time, space, and even death.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:37.690
You could've grasped the greatest
of freedoms. Won't you regret it?

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:41.860
I don't know yet.

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:47.330
But I wanna live through
all the good and bad things

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:48.950
that happen in my life.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:53.710
You people lose your freedom,
unaware of it happening,

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:56.800
and eventually, lose yourself.

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:01.130
I'm not losing my freedom.

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:05.720
It's more like I'm gaining
irreplaceable bonds.

00:22:12.190 --> 00:22:14.270
I just don't get it.

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:19.110
Yomogi?

00:22:30.750 --> 00:22:32.870
Well done.

00:22:32.870 --> 00:22:35.830
You're quite the joker, Minami.

00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:38.130
Hey...

00:22:39.130 --> 00:22:41.840
You're still saying "Minami."

00:22:44.050 --> 00:22:48.140
Everyone's waiting... C'mon, Yume!

00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:53.850
"School Festival"

00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:52.850
Well done!

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:54.310
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:56.900
Embarrassment can be a good thing.

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:11.290
Our scars aren't healing.

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:14.370
I hope they stay with us forever.

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:16.290
Why?

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:20.590
So we remember,
no matter how many years pass.

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:29.470
What Was I Entrusted With?

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:29.470
Final Episode
